  "id": "developmental-scale",
  "term": "developmental scale",
  "definition": "A developmental scale is a tool for assessing a child’s development across developmental areas. In this source, it refers to an individualized form of assessment, in contrast to a parent-completed developmental questionnaire, and different assessment methods may yield different results.",
